(a) current progress of the Amrit Bharat Station Scheme (ABSS), including the number of stations under redevelopment, ongoing works, and projects completed so far, State-wise, particularly in Jharkhand;
(b) details of the multimodal integration and tourism circuits developed throughout the country particularly in Andhra Pradesh and Telangana;
(c) whether the Ministry has assessed the impact of the Amrit Bharat Station Scheme on passenger satisfaction;
(d) if so, the details thereof; 
(e) whether the stations under the scheme have been developing within the targeted timeline; and
(f) if so, the details thereof?

(a) the year-wise budgetary allocations, funds released and incentives disbursed under the Production Linked Incentive (PLI) Scheme for Food Processing Industries since its inception, along with the segment-wise and category-wise number of beneficiaries approved particularly in Bihar;
(b) the total investment mobilised, additional production achieved, incentives disbursed and employment generated at the national level, the details thereof State-wise;
(c) the extent of participation of MSMEs, cooperatives and organic or innovative food product manufacturers under the Scheme; and
(d) whether any steps have been taken to enhance value addition, brand development and global competitiveness of Indian food products?

(a) total number of micro food processing enterprises formalised under PMFME Scheme since inception, State/UT-wise, along with cumulative investment mobilised;
(b) whether sector-wise distribution of sanctioned units, including participation of women, SHGs, FPOs and aspirational districts are maintained and monitored;
(c) whether operational status and utilisation levels of sanctioned common infrastructure facilities and incubation centres have been reviewed State/UT-wise;
(d) whether measurable outcomes in terms of employment generation, turnover growth and market linkages and export promotion have been evaluated and further scaling up proposed; and
(e) roadmap for further scaling up credit flow, branding support and exports under PMFME during remaining period of implementation?

(a) the total allocation made for restructuring of the Krishonnati Yojana in the Union Budget 2026, along with the main components and purposes for which funds are earmarked;
(b) the specific targets or benchmarks set under the Yojana for enhancing farmers’ income, including timelines and measurable indicators;
